u samo na srednju strelicu.\n                Ako vidite ← u sredini, pritisnite levo crveno dugme, a ako vidite →, pritisnite desno crveno dugme.\n                Ovaj zadatak će se ponoviti više puta. Da bi započeli test kliknite plavo dugme. \n                <br /><br />\n                Na primer:<br />\n            <p style=\"font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 1rem;\">→ → ← → →</p>\n\n            <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-center gap-4 mb-4\">\n                <button class=\"btn btn-danger px-5\">Tačno</button>\n                <button class=\"btn btn-danger px-5\">Netačno</button>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" (click)=\"startTest()\">Započni test</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div *ngIf=\"!showInstructions\" style=\"margin-top: 100px;\">\n            <div *ngIf=\"!testEnded\" class=\"mb-4\" style=\"font-size: 100px;\">\n                <span *ngFor=\"let s of stimulus\">  {{s === 'left' ? '\\u2190' : '\\u2192' }} </span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div *ngIf=\"!testEnded\" class=\"d-flex justify-content-between\" style=\"margin-top: 100px;\">\n                <button class=\"btn btn-danger btn-lg px-5\" style=\"height: 60px; width: 150px; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 3rem;\" (click)=\"answer('left')\"> </button>\n                <button class=\"btn btn-danger btn-lg px-5\" style=\"height: 60px; width: 150px;\" (click)=\"answer('right')\"> </button>\n            </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div> -->\n\n<p> flanker</p>\n"],"mappings":";AAOA,OAAM,MAAOA,oBAAoB;EAC/BC,QAAQA,CAAA;IACN;EAAA;EACD,QAAAC,CAAA,G;qBAHUF,oBAAoB;EAAA;EAAA,QAAAG,EAAA,G;UAApBH,oBAAoB;IAAAI,SAAA;IAAAC,KAAA;IAAAC,IAAA;IAAAC,QAAA,WAAAC,8BAAAC,EAAA,EAAAC,GAAA;MAAA,IAAAD,EAAA;QC8BjCE,EAAA,CAAAC,cAAA,QAAG;QAACD,EAAA,CAAAE,MAAA,eAAO;QAAAF,EAAA,CAAAG,YAAA,EAAI"},"metadata":{},"sourceType":"module","externalDependencies":[]}